    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 245,
        "y": 1378,
        "w": 146,
        "h": 38
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "One Pager",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "One Pager",
          "href": "https://2985fbec-fbea-42c8-b0ec-e741836772d0.filesusr.com/ugd/1f3734_db3252979e94479a8d3b44617b6f59b4.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "25px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "center",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 799,
        "y": 569,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 304
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "As a designer, I have been deeply engaged in shaping the game concept from the start to the vertical slice.\nI have conceptualized the core gameplay loop and established the fundamental design pillars that have influenced all our design decisions.\nI have consistently contributed to and participated in all design meetings, playing a crucial role in every decision throughout the game's development.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "25px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 799,
        "y": 956,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 152
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "I also contributed to the documentation of the GDD for Bugs N’ Guns, focusing primarily on the 3Cs (Character, Camera, Control) and the sections related to combat, encounters, enemies, weapons and interactive elements.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "25px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 799,
        "y": 1108,
        "w": 820,
        "h": 114
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "To achieve this, we used Notion to create a comprehensive GDD, and tools like Photoshop and Illustrator to produce detailed documentation for art and programming purposes.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "25px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 1534,
        "y": 1232,
        "w": 81,
        "h": 110
      },
      "type": "button",
