    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 1529,
        "y": 1386,
        "w": 90,
        "h": 30
      },
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h2",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "GDD",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "GDD",
          "href": "https://sable-sandalwood-dee.notion.site/6b3e2cf0924a4829b68156f894e69264?v=b19f1f11e7794bb48de4bc0fd682faea"
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "center",
        "lineHeight": "normal",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 779,
        "y": 1630,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "One of the most challenging tasks in design is to ensure that everyone shares the same vision for the game.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 779,
        "y": 1735,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 210
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "However, it's also the most important because if not, each team member will have a different idea of what is being done, leading to aimless decision-making that can harm the final result.\n\nTo tackle this in the design team, we established three pillars and three verbs to build the gameplay upon:",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 779,
        "y": 1980,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 35
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "CORE VERBS: Escort, cooperate, shoot",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 779,
        "y": 2015,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 35
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "EXPERIENCE PILLARS: Reactivity, Dependence, Frenzy",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 779,
        "y": 2085,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "From these foundations, we designed the entire game, from the core loop to the levels, including weapons, enemies, elemental interactions, and the rest of the mechanics and dynamics present in Bugs N' Guns.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 779,
        "y": 2225,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 210
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Coming to these conclusions was undoubtedly the most time-consuming part of discussions and meetings for us. However, once we established the anchor on which all our decisions pivoted, the rest came much more easily and naturally (not to say there weren't any discussions), as it was no longer about designing based on what each team member believed to be the most fun, but rather on what best supported those anchors we had set.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 779,
        "y": 2470,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "That way, when discussing any feature, we always referred back to what aligns best with our pillars to make the decision. In this manner, even if another idea seemed more fun to you, ultimately the team would conclude what was best.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
