      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1f3734_dcd325a4078d4d33b84695d2b390b58b~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_406,h_336,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/1f3734_dcd325a4078d4d33b84695d2b390b58b~mv2.png",
      "srcset": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1f3734_dcd325a4078d4d33b84695d2b390b58b~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_406,h_336,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/1f3734_dcd325a4078d4d33b84695d2b390b58b~mv2.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1f3734_dcd325a4078d4d33b84695d2b390b58b~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_406,h_336,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/1f3734_dcd325a4078d4d33b84695d2b390b58b~mv2.png 2x",
      "alt": "TheWeaponsAndTheElement_BNG.png",
      "name": null,
      "original": null,
      "natural": {
        "w": 406,
        "h": 336
      },
      "background": false,
      "link": null,
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 2790,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "After establishing our pillars, we began to develop the mechanics and dynamics that would make up the game.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 2860,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "A very representative example of how we followed our pillars in the design process is the elements and their interactions.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 2965,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "The elements and their interactions are one of the central axes on which combat revolves.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 3035,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "This system is designed in such a way that each player has two weapons. These weapons, when combined, produce powerful interactions either on enemies or on the ground.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 3175,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "It is important to clarify that a player's weapons only interact with those of the other player, meaning their two elemental weapons do not create any combinations.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 3245,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "This was decided to promote one of our core verbs, which is cooperation, as well as one of our experience pillars, which is dependency. Without mutual assistance, it will be impossible to progress in the adventure.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 3385,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Besides combat, the element system is also used in the different puzzles of the game, where players will have to combine their weapons to escort the train through the hostile terrains of Bugs n' Guns.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 3490,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "By doing this with their weapons, we also promote another core verb, shoot, as it was decided that all the actions and puzzles that players have to solve would be done by shooting.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 3630,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 105
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Lastly, a very fast-paced combat was established to generate frenzy, while dynamically changing environments and situations to make players make on-the-fly decisions, promoting reactivity.",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
    {
      "section": 0,
      "rect": {
        "x": 777,
        "y": 3735,
        "w": 865,
        "h": 70
      },
      "type": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "level": null,
      "text": "We achieve this by changing the environment or adding obstacles that players have to deal with while escorting the train",
      "links": [],
      "style": {
        "font": "prompt, sans-serif",
        "size": "20px",
        "weight": "400",
        "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
        "align": "start",
        "lineHeight": "35px",
        "letterSpacing": "normal",
        "transform": "none",
        "italic": false
      }
    },
